Compare acids, bases and salts as actual supplied materials (@cs-acid-alkali: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @chemical-supply-systems, #source "../sources/Caustic-Soda-Handbook-OxyChem.lingua#r_1MRFTA19NDBFBQXC69CCRQPAME", #source "../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Ammonia-Acids-Fertilisers-BREF.lingua#r_45NWBJYAMXXSRV071A57EM02GB", #source "../sources/Chemical-Supply-Chain-Profiles-EPA.lingua#r_0E09Q6T7CC9HNWZB3N84E7K21A", #chemical-supply-systems "Fertilizer-supply-nutrient-basis-physical-form-and-users.lingua#r_282XJZ5C7NJD9JGPYRWQV933Z4") { r_625W6RZMDFFY4CE2NS8QAVXD1C
**Read:** [Caustic Soda Handbook — OxyChem](../sources/Caustic-Soda-Handbook-OxyChem.lingua#r_1MRFTA19NDBFBQXC69CCRQPAME), the entire handbook and chosen grade documents; [Large Volume Inorganic Chemicals — Ammonia, Acids and Fertilisers, BREF LVIC-AAF](../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Ammonia-Acids-Fertilisers-BREF.lingua#r_45NWBJYAMXXSRV071A57EM02GB), complete relevant acid-process chapters; [Water-treatment chemical supply-chain profiles — EPA](../sources/Chemical-Supply-Chain-Profiles-EPA.lingua#r_0E09Q6T7CC9HNWZB3N84E7K21A), complete chosen acid/base/salt profiles.

Choose one acid, one base and one salt with distinct uses. For each, identify actual concentration/form, impurity limits, relevant temperature-dependent properties, packaging/contact materials, transfer route and acceptance evidence. A formula such as HCl or NaOH leaves out much of the physical object being shipped: water, stabilisers, other constituents and the conditions determining its phase and flow.

Use a complete producer handbook for the alkali case and whole applicable industrial-reference chapters for acid and salt production. Develop a table that separates chemical function, active-content basis and supply-system requirements. Include density, phase/solubility, viscosity and materials questions only where their actual measured domains are known; a table for one grade cannot silently be used for all others.

Compare a direct bulk delivery, a distributor's repacking/dilution and a recovered source. Trace where identity and evidence can become disconnected. Calculate transported mass per unit of useful function, then add storage, conditioning, testing and residual costs on a declared basis. Defend an acceptable source-to-use arrangement, including what must be checked after a change. Later specialist chemistry and equipment subjects can deepen the transformations without duplicating this transfer account.

**Continue:** [Follow fertiliser ingredients through nutrient and physical requirements](Fertilizer-supply-nutrient-basis-physical-form-and-users.lingua#r_282XJZ5C7NJD9JGPYRWQV933Z4).

